{"id":"ff80d886763151d0","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-hornstar.md","title":"Source sets and star closure of pure Horn DNFs","display":"df-hornstar — Source sets and star closure of pure Horn DNFs","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-hornstar","aliases":["27-df-hornstar"],"display":"df-hornstar — Source sets and star closure of pure Horn DNFs","depends_on":["[[27-df-hornclosure]]","[[27-df-forwardchaining]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§6.7.3 Definitions 6.10–6.13","source_statement":"Source sets and star closure of pure Horn DNFs","source_printed_pages":"303","source_pdf_pages":"327","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-with-local-domain-extension"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-hornstar"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-hornstar</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hornstar — Source sets and star closure of pure Horn DNFs"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"866e5085ffe52570\" href=\"?note=866e5085ffe52570\" title=\"27-df-hornclosure\">27-df-hornclosure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7a057444873ebdd2\" href=\"?note=7a057444873ebdd2\" title=\"27-df-forwardchaining\">27-df-forwardchaining</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§6.7.3 Definitions 6.10–6.13"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ff80d886763151d0\" href=\"?note=ff80d886763151d0\" title=\"Source sets and star closure of pure Horn DNFs\">Source sets and star closure of pure Horn DNFs</a>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"303"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"327"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-with-local-domain-extension"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n\">\\(h\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in\\mathrm{PureHornDNF}_n\">\\(\\eta\\in\\mathrm{PureHornDNF}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\eta)=h\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\eta)=h\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornCl}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{HornCl}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"866e5085ffe52570\" href=\"?note=866e5085ffe52570\" title=\"27-df-hornclosure\">27-df-hornclosure</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R\">\\(\\mathcal R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7a057444873ebdd2\" href=\"?note=7a057444873ebdd2\" title=\"27-df-forwardchaining\">27-df-forwardchaining</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq[n]\">\\(A\\subseteq[n]\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StarIrr}_h\">\\(\\mathrm{StarIrr}_h\\)</span> 是本节引入的 DNF 上的一元谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S(\\eta)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq[n]:\\exists j\\in[n]\\;((A,j)\\in\\mathcal R(\\eta))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S(\\eta)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq[n]:\\exists j\\in[n]\\;((A,j)\\in\\mathcal R(\\eta))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I_h(A)\\coloneqq\\{T_{\\{x_i:i\\in A\\}\\cup\\{\\bar x_j\\}}:j\\in\\mathrm{HornCl}_n(h,A)\\setminus A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I_h(A)\\coloneqq\\{T_{\\{x_i:i\\in A\\}\\cup\\{\\bar x_j\\}}:j\\in\\mathrm{HornCl}_n(h,A)\\setminus A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Star}_h(\\eta)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{A\\in\\mathcal S(\\eta)}I_h(A),\\qquad\\sigma(\\eta)\\coloneqq|\\mathcal S(\\eta)|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Star}_h(\\eta)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{A\\in\\mathcal S(\\eta)}I_h(A),\\qquad\\sigma(\\eta)\\coloneqq|\\mathcal S(\\eta)|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StarIrr}_h(\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\eta=\\mathrm{Star}_h(\\eta)\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subsetneq\\mathcal S(\\eta)\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\\left(\\bigcup_{A\\in\\mathcal A}I_h(A)\\right)\\neq h\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{StarIrr}_h(\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\eta=\\mathrm{Star}_h(\\eta)\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subsetneq\\mathcal S(\\eta)\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\\left(\\bigcup_{A\\in\\mathcal A}I_h(A)\\right)\\neq h\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 6.10 从属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QCl}(\\mathrm{PI}(h))\">\\(\\mathrm{QCl}(\\mathrm{PI}(h))\\)</span> 的纯 Horn 蕴涵项的正源端定义 h-star；Definition 6.12 仅对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\subseteq\\mathrm{QCl}(\\mathrm{PI}(h))\">\\(\\eta\\subseteq\\mathrm{QCl}(\\mathrm{PI}(h))\\)</span> 定义 star closure。本节点将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_h(A)\">\\(I_h(A)\\)</span> 定义于任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq[n]\">\\(A\\subseteq[n]\\)</span>，并将 star closure 定义于任意表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 的 pure Horn DNF。这是语义闭包给出的本地定义域推广，不能冒充原书未加限制的逐字定义。下游 <code>27-thm-hornstarsourcemin</code> 仍保留原书的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\subseteq\\mathrm{QCl}(\\mathrm{PI}(h))\">\\(\\eta\\subseteq\\mathrm{QCl}(\\mathrm{PI}(h))\\)</span> 前提及未核验限制。把每个实际源端 A 扩充为所有由 A 可推得的头。各 I_h(A) 中的项一致，且原规则的头都在闭包中，故星闭包包含原表示且不改变函数。StarIrr 要按整个源端星删除，区别于逐项不可约。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-hornclosure","status":"resolved","id":"866e5085ffe52570","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-hornclosure]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-forwardchaining","status":"resolved","id":"7a057444873ebdd2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-forwardchaining]]","embed":false},{"target":"Source sets and star closure of pure Horn DNFs","status":"resolved","id":"ff80d886763151d0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · source_statement","heading":"","excerpt":"[[Source sets and star closure of pure Horn DNFs]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-hornclosure","status":"resolved","id":"866e5085ffe52570","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$h\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n$，$\\eta\\in\\mathrm{PureHornDNF}_n$，$\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\eta)=h$；$\\mathrm{HornCl}_n$ 见 [[27-df-hornclosure]]，$\\mathcal R$ 见 [[27-df-forwardchaining]]。$A\\subseteq[n]$。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-forwardchaining","status":"resolved","id":"7a057444873ebdd2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$h\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n$，$\\eta\\in\\mathrm{PureHornDNF}_n$，$\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\eta)=h$；$\\mathrm{HornCl}_n$ 见 [[27-df-hornclosure]]，$\\mathcal R$ 见 [[27-df-forwardchaining]]。$A\\subseteq[n]$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta\\in\\mathrm{PureHornDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\eta)=h","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HornCl}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StarIrr}_h","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S(\\eta)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq[n]:\\exists j\\in[n]\\;((A,j)\\in\\mathcal R(\\eta))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"I_h(A)\\coloneqq\\{T_{\\{x_i:i\\in A\\}\\cup\\{\\bar x_j\\}}:j\\in\\mathrm{HornCl}_n(h,A)\\setminus A\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Star}_h(\\eta)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{A\\in\\mathcal S(\\eta)}I_h(A),\\qquad\\sigma(\\eta)\\coloneqq|\\mathcal S(\\eta)|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StarIrr}_h(\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\eta=\\mathrm{Star}_h(\\eta)\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subsetneq\\mathcal S(\\eta)\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\\left(\\bigcup_{A\\in\\mathcal A}I_h(A)\\right)\\neq h\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QCl}(\\mathrm{PI}(h))","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta\\subseteq\\mathrm{QCl}(\\mathrm{PI}(h))","display":false},{"tex":"I_h(A)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta\\subseteq\\mathrm{QCl}(\\mathrm{PI}(h))","display":false}],"bytes":2453,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-53","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-hornstar|df-hornstar — Source sets and star closure of pure Horn DNFs]]"},{"id":"936e95274169e839","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$h\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n$，$\\eta\\in\\mathrm{PureHornDNF}_n$，$\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\eta)=h$，$\\eta\\subseteq\\mathrm{QCl}(\\mathrm{PI}(h))$，$\\mathrm{StarIrr}_h(\\eta)$；源端计数和星不可约见 [[27-df-hornstar]]，闭包和素项见 [[27-df-consensusclosure]]、[[27-df-piset]]。"}],"outgoing":["866e5085ffe52570","7a057444873ebdd2"]}